WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.600
Hello Margate residents my name is
Graham Razey and i'm the chair of the

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.200
Margate Town Deal board.
We have been presented with a fantastic

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.679
opportunity by government as part of 101
towns and cities from across England

00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:18.480
chance to bid for up to 25 million
pounds worth of funding

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.320
to support the regeneration and economic
recovery of Margate and its surrounding

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.340
area.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.760
This is where we need you. The chance to get

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.519
involved and shape that future. 
You could do that by either engaging

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:33.120
with us in physical meetings,
in digital coffee mornings, there's a

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.239
chance to take part in a survey
there's also a chance to apply to become

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:40.239
part of our people's board.
To find out more information please

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:44.800
visit margatetowndeal.co.uk
I really look forward to working with

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.960
you all over the coming weeks months and
years

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:59.840
and you know making Margate the best
place that we can possibly make it to be

00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:04.320
you

